<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1. The above results have been reviewed by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors of the Company in their respective meetings held on February 5th,  2020. The Statutory Auditors have carried out limited review of the Unaudited Consolidated financial results for the quarter and nine months ended December 31,2019   n  n2.  The company and its subsidiaries are engaged in the business of sale of Seeds &amp; Micronutrients and there are no other reportable segments under Ind AS 108  Operating Segments .   n  n3.  In pursuance of approval by National Company Law Tribunal, M/s.Kexveg India Pvt Ltd, a wholly owned subsidiary was merged into M/s. Kaveri Microteck Pvt Ltd, another wholly owned subsidiary during the current period.    n  n4.  The Consolidated results for the quarter and nine months ended December  31, 2018 are not subjected to limited review.   n  n5. The Company has adopted Ind AS 116  Leases  effective April 1, 2019 and the impact of the same is insignificant.  n  n6.  In pursuance of shareholders approval, the company has offered buyback of 28,00,000 Nos equity shares of Rs.2/- each at Rs.700/- per share. Pending completion of buyback process as on December 31, 2019, the effect of the same has not been reflected in the above financial results.The Process has been completed as on January 23, 2020.   n  n7.  Previous period figures have been regrouped and reclassified, wherever necessary, for the purpose of comparision.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
